This depends greatly on what you already have.  If you're just wielding
magicbane, you're fairly wimpy in melee, but if you've got Frost Brand
you're probably in pretty good shape.

Typically my wizards use the following:

Armor - SDSM, CoMR, T-shirt, speed boots, gauntlets of dex, helm of
telepathy or brilliance (depending on fail rates, etc.)
Weapons - Magicbane, and some sort of artifact longsword (Frost Brand,
Fire Brand, Excalibur, even Vorpy) or non-artifact longsword or crysknife.
Other - pretty typical.  Unicorn horn, blessed BoH, lizard corpse,
blindfold, skeleton key, stethoscope, luckstone, amulet of usefulness
(life saving, magical breathing, ESP, reflection depending on other
equipment), assorted scrolls and potions (mostly in the bag), oilskin sack
to protect BoH from curses and water, rings of slow digestion, free
action, conflict, levitation, regeneration.  Probably more I've forgotten.

