Finger of Death and Magic Missile both work well on Jabberwocks,
Minotaurs, Rodney, the riders (except death on death -- don't try this),
air elementals, mind flayers, disenchanters, titans, etc.  Magic missile
also works well on major demons, liches, death, and really just about
everything else.  (The only things MM doesn't work well on: Archons,
silver/gray dragons or anything with reflection/CoMR.)



